# pixel robot: original pixel art, 24x28 canvas.
# palette: <char> <r> <g> <b>   ('.' = transparent / keep what is underneath)
@palette
K 18 11 13
C 230 57 70
R 255 77 94
D 150 30 42
B 242 167 160
A 224 165 92
Y 255 214 120
V 40 22 26
W 255 236 232
S 150 205 255
G 120 230 190

# @layer <name> <x> <y>   then rows
